WEBVTT

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.594
They love a good personal story.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.913
But you know what?

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:04.088
I lied.

00:01:04.112 --> 00:01:05.453
(Laughter)

00:01:05.477 --> 00:01:07.791
And not because
the things I said weren't true --

00:01:07.815 --> 00:01:10.223
I mean, my parents were talking
about this stuff.

00:01:10.247 --> 00:01:14.742
But that's not really why
I decided to jump into finance.

00:01:15.552 --> 00:01:17.599
I just really wanted to pay my rent.

00:01:17.623 --> 00:01:20.480
(Laughter)

00:01:20.504 --> 00:01:22.037
And here's the thing.

00:01:22.061 --> 00:01:27.014
The reality of having to pay my rent
and do real adult things

00:01:27.038 --> 00:01:30.062
is something that we're rarely
willing to admit to employers,